-05-22","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/war-spark-ravnica-rallying-reluctant-2019-05-22#:~:text=We%20need%20to%20reconstitute,uniting%20all%20ten%20guilds.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"War of the Spark: Ravnica – Rallying the Reluctant\" by Greg Weisman. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 22 May 2019."}},{"id":"war-spark-ravnica-rallying-reluctant-2019-05-22-e10","era":null,"summary":"Attendees argue about surrender or hiding, and Vorel blames planeswalkers while the archer and Samut insist Bolas is never sated.","participants":["vorel","samut","miss-longbow","dack-fayden"],"location":"azorius-senate-house","importance":"major","page":"stories/war-spark-ravnica-rallying-reluctant-2019-05-22","order":615,"story_date":"2019-05-22","storyline":"War of the Spark","source":"wizards","paragraph":129,"quote":"There is literally nothing left of my world, Skalla, thanks to him.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/war-spark-ravnica-rallying-reluctant-2019-05-22#:~:text=There%20is%20literally%20nothing,Skalla%2C%20thanks%20to%20him.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"War of the Spark: Ravnica – Rallying the Reluctant","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Greg Weisman"],"date":"2019-05-22","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/war-spark-ravnica-rallying-reluctant-2019-05-22","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/war-spark-ravnica-rallying-reluctant-2019-05-22#:~:text=There%20is%20literally%20nothing,Skalla%2C%20thanks%20to%20him.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"War of the Spark: Ravnica – Rallying the Reluctant\" by Greg Weisman. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 22 May 2019."}},{"id":"war-spark-ravnica-rallying-reluctant-2019-05-22-e11","era":null,"summary":"Gideon, encouraged by Ajani's reminder of the Oath, vows to retake Ravnica with Blackblade and the crowd gathers around him.","participants":["gideon-jura","ajani-goldmane","