":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"War of the Spark: Ravnica – Rallying the Reluctant","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Greg Weisman"],"date":"2019-05-22","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/war-spark-ravnica-rallying-reluctant-2019-05-22","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/war-spark-ravnica-rallying-reluctant-2019-05-22#:~:text=one%20a%27%20them%20God%2DEternals,of%20those%20undead%20creepies%21","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"War of the Spark: Ravnica – Rallying the Reluctant\" by Greg Weisman. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 22 May 2019."}},{"id":"war-spark-ravnica-ashes-2019-06-12-e0","era":null,"summary":"Gideon addresses the second summit at the Azorius Senate House and lays out a two-pronged attack to finish Bolas with Blackblade.","participants":["gideon-jura","araithia-shokta"],"location":"azorius-senate-house","importance":"minor","page":"stories/war-spark-ravnica-ashes-2019-06-12","order":618,"story_date":"2019-06-12","storyline":"War of the Spark","source":"wizards","paragraph":9,"quote":"Then I'll stab Bolas with Blackblade. And it will all be over.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/war-spark-ravnica-ashes-2019-06-12#:~:text=Then%20I%27ll%20stab%20Bolas,will%20all%20be%20over.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"War of the Spark: Ravnica—Ashes","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Greg Weisman"],"date":"2019-06-12","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/war-spark-ravnica-ashes-2019-06-12","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/war-spark-ravnica-ashes-2019-06-12#:~:text=Then%20I%27ll%20stab%20Bolas,will%20all%20be%20over.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"War of the Spark: Ravnica—Ashes\" by Greg Weisman. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 12 Jun 2019."}},{"id":"war-spark-ravnica-ashes-2019-06-12-e1","era":null,"summary":"The Gatewatch renews its Oaths, and Nissa speaks hers for t